Cell["\<\
On a closed surface the shell does not keep growing. On the square torus it \
grows linearly, levels off once it has wrapped round the short way, and \
shrinks as it closes up on the far side.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"6853b4f7-3727-48d5-aeeb-2cf6adb203ed"],

